  "title": "Lebanon: TotalEnergies enters Block 8 offshore exploration permit",
  "summary": "Paris, January 9, 2026 – TotalEnergies (35%, operator), together with its partners Eni (35%) and QatarEnergy (30%), have signed an agreement with the Lebanese government to enter Block 8 exploration permit offshore Lebanon. The consortium’s initial work program on Block 8 consists of the acquisition of a 1,200 km² 3D seismic survey, in order to […]",
